      "message": "can you give some details about how we plan to use this new (light weight hotplug interface) interface from the kernel drivers/modules. User space has the interface to specify whatever HP state they want to put for a given CPU. I believe we will have a kernel API around cpu_down() and cpu_up().\n\nThis interface nicely fits with CPU hotplug. so a isolated/paused CPU will be in the lower HP state and upon actualy hotplug, it will move to the final state. So there is no explicit sync needed like we have in isolation code.",
