      "message": "normal case kthreads will be true\n\npause case kthreads will be false\n\nsuggest we call this variable migrate_pinned_kthreads.\n\nThis is a neat idea, lighter than our implementation where we dequeue such tasks temporarily. Vincent\u0027s idea will be an issue if there are hundreds of pinned kthreads - we will end up skipping them many times. But we only have a handful of kernel threads so this should be fine.",
